chat_memory.prompt:
A talk between {name} and {player}:
{talk}
Write, as {name}'s own short note to self, what {name} will remember of it: what {player} wanted, offered or said, and how it went. One sentence, at most twenty words, in the third person about {player}. The note only: no heading, no 'Note to self'.
